//EVENTS
  "willyevent.01": "Ahoy, ${lad^lass^laddie}$.",
  "willyevent.02": "Are ya buyin' or sellin'?$1",
  "willyevent.03i": "Just buying.",
  "willyevent.03ii": "Just selling.",
  "willyevent.03iii": "A bit of both.",
  "willyevent.04i": "Hope you brought enough money!$1",
  "willyevent.04ii": "So you want to sell somethin'?$2",
  "willyevent.04iii": "So you want to sell somethin'?$2",
  "willyevent.05": "Y'know, I've been thinking... I may have been too strict on what you can sell me.$2#$b# I want to help you out, @, because you're a new face in the valley, and you have a kind spirit.$3",
  "willyevent.06": "Have you been picking up stuff on the beach? There's new stuff washing ashore everyday.$1#$b# You have also maybe fished up something else then fish by now.",
  "willyevent.07": "So, starting tomorrow, I'm willing to buy anything you find on the beach or in the waters. Not just fish.#$b# Hope that'll help you out!$1",
  "willyevent.08": "Willy buys more items!",
  "willyevent.09": "Hopefully this motivates you more to keep the art of fishin' alive, ${lad^lass^laddie}$.#$b# And maybe you can use that extra cash on a crab pot for 1,500g? Or a new fishing rod?$3",
  "willyevent.10": "I also sell fish tanks for...",

  "clintevent.01": "Hi @! What can I get you?",
  "clintevent.02": "Coming right up!$1#$b# Clint asked if you could join him and Willy for a moment.$3",
  "clintevent.03": "Err... Hello, farmer.",
  "clintevent.04": "Ahoy, @.$1",
  "clintevent.05": "Willy told me he decided to buy your beach forage and stuff, and how you reinvested the money in his shop.",
  "clintevent.06": "... Could've left out that second part.$2",
  "clintevent.07": "Err, anyway...$4#$b# It got me thinking, so I spoke with Gunther about artifacts. He taught me a thing or two. Gave me some contacts.",
  "clintevent.08": "What I wanted to tell you is, starting tomorrow, I am willing to buy your artifacts.$3#$b# In fact, anything coming from geodes or artifact troves!$1",
  "clintevent.09": "Clint buys more items!",
  "clintevent.10": "I hope that convinces you to bring even more geodes or artifact troves next time!#$b#Remember, I open them for only 25g a piece.#$b# And maybe consider upgrading your tools with that extra cash.$1",
  "clintevent.11": "Well spoken, Clint!$1",

  "robinevent.01": "Good morning, @.#$b# Hope you're happy with your coop!$1",
  "robinevent.02": "That's great!$1#$b# I hope gathering and bringing all the materials was not too much trouble.#$b# But, I want to make it easier for you. From tomorrow on, I will buy all building materials from you. That way, you can bring excess and get rid of it immediately!",
  "robinevent.03": "Robin buys more items!",
  "robinevent.04": "Also, may I recommend you to buy a telephone? You can call me and ask the building components anytime! The other shops also own phones. Only 2,000g!#$b# Or, consider my workbench for 2,000g to make crafting easier!$1#$b#And if you want some entertainment, maybe pick up a plasma TV for a measly price of 4,500g!$4",

//QUESTS
  "quest_harvey.title": "Curious For Ginger",
  "quest_harvey.description": "Harvey is curious about the healing properties of this forageable from Ginger Island.",
  "quest_harvey.objective": "Bring Harvey 5 Ginger.",

//MAIL
  "harveyrequestmail.text": "Hi @!^I heard from Willy you went to Ginger Island, how cool is that! Remember to stay safe from the wild flora and fauna, and not to get sunburn.^^About that local flora though... If the name Ginger Island means anything, I was wondering if there is ginger to be found? Don't worry, it's completely safe to touch. During my studies I learned about its medicinal properties, and I would like to experiment with it. Five should be enough.^^Thanks in advance!^   -Harvey",
  "harveyrequestmail.title": "Curious For Ginger",
  "harveyquestcompletemail.text": "@,^Great news! I have studied the ginger you shared with me. I was feeling nauseous the other day (don't worry!), and so I grinded up some ginger in my meal. The nausea was instantly gone! I then heard from Jodi that Vincent likes ginger only when turned into a drink called ginger ale. I attached one to this mail.^^As a thank you, starting tomorrow, I would like to buy any ginger or ginger ale from you! And when you visit my clinic, be sure to buy some medical supplies for your island trips, because not everything can be fixed by nature (and I could use the money).^   -Harvey",
  "harveyquestcompletemail.title": "Thanks For The Ginger!",
  "sandymail.text": "Hi sweetie,^ Greetings from Calico Desert! Come visit me soon, I'm really bored out here. So, I thought it might help to let you know that from tomorrow on, I will buy anything you find in the desert! I know those Starfruit Seeds can be expensive, but I can't lower the price.^^Hopefully see you soon!^   -Sandy^   P.S. Here's a small gift to get you started",
  "sandymail.title": "Sandy Buys More Items"
}